[HEADING=1][DD] RPG Suite[/HEADING]
Core RPG domain platform (Genres, Publishers, Dashboard) and modular integration bridge connecting [B][DD] Character Database[/B], [B][DD] Dice Roller[/B], [B][DD] BattleMap Generator[/B], and [B][DD] Handout Generator[/B].

[HEADING=2]Features[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*]Central management for RPG Genres (icons, counters, automatic style properties) and RPG Publishers (logos, URLs, license notices, JSON/ZIP export & import)
[*]AdminCP Ecosystem & Add-on Overview showing installed, disabled, and available RPG Suite modules with direct enable toggles
[*]Public RPG Suite Dashboard ([ICODE]/rpg/[/ICODE]) with a left-sidebar Genre filter across all genre-aware widgets
[*]Setting-to-Wireset linking and automatic Campaign Forum wireset provisioning when creating new campaign forums
[*]Rollable character attributes/skills, character-specific preferred Dice Sets, and "Roll as Character" integration in the Dice Roller
[*]Campaign resource linking for BattleMaps and Handouts (with GM-only or party-visible access) and an optional In-Thread RPG Companion Bar
[/LIST]

[HEADING=2]Requirements[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*]XenForo 2.3.0+, PHP 8.2.0+
[*][DD] - Core Library (v1.6.3+)
[*]Optional [URL='https://forum.dice-dragons.de/downloads/categories/icon-interfaces.61/']Icon Interfaces[/URL] (such as [ICODE][DD] Icon: Game-Icons[/ICODE]) for extended RPG genre icons
[/LIST]

[HEADING=2]Configuration / Usage[/HEADING]
Configure RPG Suite options, Genres, Publishers, and inspect module status in the AdminCP under [B]RPG Suite[/B].
